# Model Routing (opencode-go landscape, ratified 2026-08-01, re-routed 2026-08-02, re-paired 2026-08-20)

## Canonical relationship

This file is the always-injected routing policy. The live implementation lives in
`~/.omo/omo.jsonc` (agents map, categories map,
background_task.modelConcurrency). `opencode.jsonc` base model/small_model/agents are
untouched by routing. **Where this file and the config differ, the config wins** (it
executes); this file records intent so future edits stay justified.

## Routing table (agent → model → fallback)

| Agent | Model | Fallback |
|---|---|---|
| oracle / prometheus | `opencode-go/glm-5.2` | `opencode-go/mimo-v2.5` |
| test-writer / review | `opencode-go/gpt-5.6-luna` | `opencode-go/qwen3.7-plus` |
| metis / momus | `opencode-go/glm-5.2` | `opencode-go/mimo-v2.5` |
| architect / sisyphus / build / worker | `opencode-go/mimo-v2.5` | `opencode-go/glm-5.2` |
| hephaestus / atlas | `opencode-go/mimo-v2.5` | (existing; both disabled) |
| explore / scout / quick | `opencode/mimo-v2.5-free` | (existing) |
| general | category `unspecified-low` | (existing) |
| librarian / multimodal-looker / sisyphus-junior / writing / git | `opencode/deepseek-v4-flash-free` | (existing) |

